Subject: [PATCH] stage(checkout-seed): /awakening send-seed human_email
 fallback + uuid threaded to thank-you; /tiers CTA -> /awakening ceremony

Client half of the live-checkout silent-seed repair (BUILD+STAGE ONLY, deploy Jared-gated). Builds ON 94ddc969 sessionUuid plumbing.

P1a awakening-post-payment.js: human_email = payerInfo email ELSE window._pbState.email (subscription onApprove carries only subscriptionID -> was sending human_email='' -> /api/send-seed silent-400 for every new subscriber). Seed body now uses hoisted humanEmail.

P1b awakening-post-payment.js: hoisted ONE durable sessionUuid (via pbGetSessionUuid) shared by send-seed AND both thank-you redirects (doRedirect + checkReturn) as ?uuid=, restoring Constitutional Rule 3 (email already rides the redirect URL, so uuid is no more sensitive). awakening-chatbox.js: pbGetSessionUuid now also mirrors to window._pbState.sessionUuid per client<->server contract (canonical store stays sessionStorage.pb_sessionUuid; _pbSessionId session_id left intact so consent-log path does not break).

P3b tiers/index.html: 3 CTA onclick openModal(tier) -> navigate /awakening?tier=X (least-blast-radius fix; /tiers had checkout WITHOUT a naming ceremony -> empty seed by design). Existing tiers PayPal/Stripe machinery left in place but unused.

Sandbox pages 9/11 (home-test-sandbox, pay-test-sandbox-3) do NOT load awakening-*.js -> is_sandbox path untouched. Static reference pages unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
